Package: safeR
Title: Strict Type Checking for R
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Charles", "Bates", , "charles.bates@earth.ox.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-8444-6322"))
Author: Charles Bates [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Charles Bates <charles.bates@earth.ox.ac.uk>
Description: The safeR package provides a set of tools for strict type
    checking in R.  It allows users to define custom classes and enforce
    type constraints on function inputs and outputs. Other utility
    functions are also provided.
